“␀␀]<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀¬@␀£␀␀Q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀b¡␀␀£␀␀£␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿS‡ø␀␀¨␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Nú␀␀ù␀␀iú␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀~Q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¡␀␀}€␀␀}€␀␀F␀␀␀ê␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿSó␀Qÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ‹£␀␀‹£␀␀‹£␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀ˆ␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿu'␀u'␀u'␀g<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ã␀¼ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿºš␀␀w—␀␀¹š␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀…␀¶␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿd^cF<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀Š]:␀	␀0;1mþ␀␀		SENIOR;0¾␀␀TRIGGER T028CPGD AFTER DELETE ON E028CPG FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
EXISTE VARCHAR (01); 
WSITREG   E098REG.SITREG%TYPE;
WINDEXP   E028ECP.INDEXP%TYPE; 

CURSOR CUR_E098REG IS
       SELECT SITREG FROM E098REG
       WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND MODSIS='GER' AND IDEREG='000INTMV01';

CURSOR CUR_E028ECP IS
       SELECT INDEXP
       FROM E028ECP
       WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND CODCPG=:OLD.CODCPG;
BEGIN
WSITREG := 'I';
FOREACH CUR_E098REG INTO WSITREG
   LOOP
   EXISTE := 'N';
   END LOOP;

IF ((WSITREG = 'A') AND (:OLD.TIPINT <> 0)) OR (WSITREG='I') THEN
   EXISTE := 'N';
   FOREACH CUR_E028ECP INTO WINDEXP
             LOOP
             EXISTE := 'S';
             END LOOP;
   IF (EXISTE = 'N') THEN
       INSERT INTO E028ECP (CODEMP,CODCPG,INDEXP) VALUES (:OLD.CODEMP,:OLD.CODCPG,0);
   END IF;
   IF (EXISTE = 'S') AND (WINDEXP <> 0) THEN
      UPDATE E028ECP SET INDEXP = 0 WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND CODCPG=:OLD.CODCPG;
   END IF;
END IF;
