¶␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ì␀␀Ì␀␀Ì␀␀5<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀×Q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀
¶␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ì␀␀Ì␀␀Ì␀␀5<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀¨␀È␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿß␀␀ß␀␀ß␀␀]<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀s`␀␀0;1;2;3;4;5yþ␀␀		SENIOR;0Ú␀␀TRIGGER T075PPCD AFTER DELETE ON E075PPC FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
EXISTE VARCHAR (01); 
WINDEXP   E075EPP.INDEXP%TYPE; 

CURSOR CUR_E075EPP IS
       SELECT INDEXP
       FROM E075EPP
       WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND CODPRO=:OLD.CODPRO AND CODDER=:OLD.CODDER AND CODCLI=:OLD.CODCLI;
BEGIN
EXISTE := 'N';
FOREACH CUR_E075EPP INTO WINDEXP
          LOOP
          EXISTE := 'S';
          END LOOP;
IF (EXISTE = 'N') THEN
    INSERT INTO E075EPP (CODEMP,CODPRO,CODDER,CODCLI,INDEXP) VALUES (:OLD.CODEMP,:OLD.CODPRO,:OLD.CODDER,:OLD.CODCLI,0);
END IF;
IF (EXISTE = 'S') AND (WINDEXP <> 0) THEN
   UPDATE E075EPP SET INDEXP = 0 WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND CODPRO=:OLD.CODPRO AND CODDER=:OLD.CODDER AND CODCLI=:OLD.CODCLI;
END IF;
