␀y"yF␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀M¬␀␀ƒ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0™␀␀L¬␀␀P¬␀␀F␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀†~q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Wý␀␀ß|}F␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀?˜␀␀Q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ß¡␀␀2×␀␀l×␀␀F␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ç—␀␀Q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀À¡␀␀ßßF␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀±@␀|˜␀␀Q␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Þ¡␀␀'×␀␀×␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿN␀␀␀0;1‚þ␀␀		SENIOR;0¾␀␀TRIGGER T083ORID AFTER DELETE ON E083ORI FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
EXISTE VARCHAR (01); 
WSITREG   E098REG.SITREG%TYPE;
WINDEXP   E083EOR.INDEXP%TYPE; 

CURSOR CUR_E098REG IS
       SELECT SITREG FROM E098REG
       WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND MODSIS='GER' AND IDEREG='000INTMV01';

CURSOR CUR_E083EOR IS
       SELECT INDEXP
       FROM E083EOR
       WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND CODORI=:OLD.CODORI;
BEGIN
WSITREG := 'I';
FOREACH CUR_E098REG INTO WSITREG
   LOOP
   EXISTE := 'N';
   END LOOP;

IF ((WSITREG = 'A') AND (:OLD.TIPINT <> 0)) OR (WSITREG='I') THEN
   EXISTE := 'N';
   FOREACH CUR_E083EOR INTO WINDEXP
             LOOP
             EXISTE := 'S';
             END LOOP;
   IF (EXISTE = 'N') THEN
       INSERT INTO E083EOR (CODEMP,CODORI,INDEXP) VALUES (:OLD.CODEMP,:OLD.CODORI,0);
   END IF;
   IF (EXISTE = 'S') AND (WINDEXP <> 0) THEN
      UPDATE E083EOR SET INDEXP = 0 WHERE CODEMP=:OLD.CODEMP AND CODORI=:OLD.CODORI;
   END IF;
