␀F␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀␀0;1þ␀␀		SENIOR;0X␀␀TRIGGER T085OBSD AFTER DELETE ON E085OBS FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
EXISTE VARCHAR (01); 
WINDEXP   E085EOB.INDEXP%TYPE; 

CURSOR CUR_E085EOB IS
       SELECT INDEXP
       FROM E085EOB
       WHERE CODCLI=:OLD.CODCLI AND SEQOBS=:OLD.SEQOBS;
BEGIN
EXISTE := 'N';
FOREACH CUR_E085EOB INTO WINDEXP
          LOOP
          EXISTE := 'S';
          END LOOP;
IF (EXISTE = 'N') THEN
    INSERT INTO E085EOB (CODCLI,SEQOBS,INDEXP) VALUES (:OLD.CODCLI,:OLD.SEQOBS,0);
END IF;
IF (EXISTE = 'S') AND (WINDEXP <> 0) THEN
   UPDATE E085EOB SET INDEXP = 0 WHERE CODCLI=:OLD.CODCLI AND SEQOBS=:OLD.SEQOBS;
