S1r<␀␀ƒÿ␀␀Ù[␀8!␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Á"␀¶!␀""␀ž<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀A␀'BÎ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀™G©DÑF‚@␀␀”ÿ␀␀Š@␀h‚␀␀µ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀„␀␀ƒ␀␀±ƒ␀␀&=␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀©@␀!␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀â"␀#␀#␀ž<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀A␀™AÎ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀HL¨L‚@␀␀”ÿ␀␀†@␀6‚␀␀µ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀G„␀␀t…␀␀y…␀␀&=␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀¨@␀␀␀␀0;1’þ␀␀		SENIOR;0ô␀␀TRIGGER T095CTOD AFTER DELETE ON E095CTO FOR EACH ROW

DECLARE
EXISTE VARCHAR (01); 
EXISTEAUX VARCHAR (01); 
WSITREG   E098REG.SITREG%TYPE;
WINDEXP   E095ECT.INDEXP%TYPE; 
WCGCCPF   E095FOR.CGCCPF%TYPE; 
WDOCIDEFOR   E095FOR.DOCIDE%TYPE; 

CURSOR CUR_E098REG IS
       SELECT SITREG FROM E098REG
       WHERE MODSIS='GER' AND IDEREG='000INTMV01';
CURSOR CUR_E095ECT IS
       SELECT INDEXP
       FROM E095ECT
       WHERE CODFOR=:OLD.CODFOR AND SEQCTO=:OLD.SEQCTO;
CURSOR CUR_E095FOR IS
       SELECT CGCCPF, DOCIDE
       FROM E095FOR
       WHERE CODFOR=:OLD.CODFOR;
BEGIN
WSITREG := 'I';
FOREACH CUR_E098REG INTO WSITREG
   LOOP
   EXISTE := 'N';
   END LOOP;

IF ((WSITREG = 'A') AND (:OLD.TIPINT <> 0)) OR (WSITREG='I') THEN
   EXISTE := 'N';
   FOREACH CUR_E095ECT INTO WINDEXP
          LOOP
          EXISTE := 'S';
          END LOOP;
   FOREACH CUR_E095FOR INTO WCGCCPF, WDOCIDEFOR
          LOOP
          EXISTEAUX := 'S';
          END LOOP;
   IF (EXISTE = 'N') THEN
       INSERT INTO E095ECT (CODFOR,SEQCTO,INDEXP,CGCCPF,DOCIDEFOR) VALUES (:OLD.CODFOR,:OLD.SEQCTO,0,WCGCCPF,WDOCIDEFOR);
   END IF;
   IF (EXISTE = 'S') AND (WINDEXP <> 0) THEN
      UPDATE E095ECT SET INDEXP = 0 WHERE CODFOR=:OLD.CODFOR AND SEQCTO=:OLD.SEQCTO;
   END IF;
END IF;
