␀Ž␀µ␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿl…␀␀l…␀␀l…␀␀&=␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀»␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ/¼␀␀µ␀␀˜¹␀␀B␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ã␀œÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿèÉ␀␀Øæ␀␀ÎÉ␀␀ð␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀Î␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÕ␀␀Õ␀␀Õ␀␀‚@␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀Î␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÕ␀␀Õ␀␀Õ␀␀‚@␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀Î␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÕ␀␀Õ␀␀Õ␀␀‚@␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀û␀°␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ¦V¦V¦VE<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀d␀Â␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÏÉ␀␀ÏÉ␀␀ÏÉ␀␀:<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀…␀Î␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ!I!I!I‚@␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀Ï␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ¤„␀␀¤„␀␀¤„␀␀&=␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀¤␀Î␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿMMM‚@␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀_␀QÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÙå␀␀Ùå␀␀Ùå␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀Î␀¶␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿƒ␀ƒ␀ƒ␀F<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀‚␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿŸ8␀Ÿ8␀Ÿ8␀><␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀1␀³ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿá¬␀␀á¬␀␀á¬␀␀J␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀¢␀&ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ–Á␀␀–Á␀␀–Á␀␀ù␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀¤␀?ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÂ␀␀Â␀␀Â␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀­␀¨ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ¬š␀␀¬š␀␀¬š␀␀ð␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀3da␀␀4d␀¢␀°␀␀5d␀6d␀!␀␀0;1;2šþ␀␀	SENIOR;08TRIGGER T120PEDD AFTER DELETE ON E120PED
BEGIN
NULL;
END	MSSQL;0d␀␀CREATE TRIGGER T120PEDD ON E120PED FOR DELETE AS
BEGIN
  DECLARE @CODUSU INT
  DECLARE @HORA INT
  DECLARE @MINUTO INT
  DECLARE @CODREP INT
  DECLARE @CODEMP INT
  DECLARE @PEDPAL INT
  DECLARE @CODFIL INT
  DECLARE @NUMPED INT
  DECLARE @SEQUENCIAL INT
  DECLARE @OBSEXC VARCHAR(100)
  DECLARE @NOMUSU VARCHAR(100)       

  -- BUSCAR HORA
  SELECT @MINUTO = DATEPART(MI, GETDATE()), @HORA = DATEPART(HH, GETDATE())
  SET @MINUTO = @HORA * 60 + @MINUTO  
  
  -- BUSCAR O USUÁRIO
  SELECT @CODUSU = B.CODUSU, @NOMUSU = A.APPUSR
    FROM R911SEC A
  INNER JOIN R999USU B ON A.APPUSR    = B.NOMUSU
   WHERE A.NUMSEC = @@SPID                            

  IF @CODUSU IS NULL
  BEGIN
    SET @CODUSU = 0
    SET @OBSEXC = 'Registro excluído pelo usuário: via webservice ou via banco de dados'
  END
  else
    SET @OBSEXC = 'Registro excluído pelo usuário: ' + @NOMUSU

  DECLARE CUR_PEDIDO CURSOR FAST_FORWARD FOR
    SELECT CODEMP, CODFIL, NUMPED, CODREP, PEDPAL FROM DELETED
   
  OPEN CUR_PEDIDO
  FETCH CUR_PEDIDO INTO @CODEMP, @CODFIL, @NUMPED, @CODREP, @PEDPAL
    WHILE @@FETCH_STATUS = 0
      BEGIN            
      --GERAR SEQUENCIAL
      EXEC GETNEXTVALUE 'E120EPE',1,'SELECT MAX(IDEEPE) FROM E120EPE',@SEQUENCIAL OUTPUT

      INSERT INTO E120EPE (IDEEPE,CODEMP,CODFIL,NUMPED,CODREP,PEDPAL,INDEXP,HOREXC,DATEXC,USUEXC,OBSEXC)
      VALUES (@SEQUENCIAL, @CODEMP, @CODFIL, @NUMPED, @CODREP, @PEDPAL, 0, @MINUTO, GETDATE(), @CODUSU, @OBSEXC)

      FETCH CUR_PEDIDO INTO @CODEMP, @CODFIL, @NUMPED, @CODREP, @PEDPAL
    END;
  CLOSE CUR_PEDIDO
  DEALLOCATE CUR_PEDIDO  
END

	ORACLE;0Œ␀␀CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER T120PEDD AFTER
  DELETE ON E120PED FOR EACH ROW DECLARE SEQUENCIAL NUMBER;
  WCODUSU NUMBER;
  WHORA   NUMBER;
  WSERVID NUMBER;
  WNOMUSU VARCHAR(100);
  WOBSEXC VARCHAR(100);
  BEGIN
    SELECT SYS_CONTEXT('USERENV','SESSIONID') INTO WSERVID FROM DUAL;
    BEGIN
      SELECT b.codusu,
        a.APPUSR
      INTO WCODUSU,
        WNOMUSU
      FROM r911sec a
      INNER JOIN r999usu b
      ON a.appusr    = b.nomusu
      WHERE a.NUMSEC = WSERVID;
      WOBSEXC := 'Registro excluído pelo usuário: ' || WNOMUSU;      
    EXCEPTION
    WHEN no_data_found THEN
      WCODUSU := 0;
      WOBSEXC := 'Registro excluído via webservice ou via banco de dados';      
    END;          
    SELECT TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(SYSDATE, 'MI')) + TO_NUMBER(TO_CHAR(SYSDATE, 'HH')) * 60
    INTO WHORA
    FROM DUAL;
    GETNEXTVALUE('E120EPE',1,'SELECT MAX(IDEEPE) FROM E120EPE',SEQUENCIAL);
    INSERT
    INTO E120EPE
      (
        IDEEPE,
        CODEMP,
        CODFIL,
        NUMPED,
        CODREP,
        PEDPAL,
        INDEXP,
        HOREXC,
        DATEXC,
        USUEXC,
        OBSEXC
      )
      VALUES
      (
        SEQUENCIAL,
        :OLD.CODEMP,
        :OLD.CODFIL,
        :OLD.NUMPED,
        :OLD.CODREP,
        :OLD.PEDPAL,
        0,
        WHORA,
        sysdate,
        WCODUSU,
        WOBSEXC
      );
  END;

	POSTGRESQL;0␀␀DO $$BEGIN
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION t120pedd$tf()
 RETURNS trigger
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$
DECLARE
	SEQUENCIAL NUMERIC;
	WHORA INTEGER;
	WSERVID R911SEC.NUMSEC%TYPE;
	WCODUSU R999USU.CODUSU%TYPE;
	WNOMUSU R911SEC.APPUSR%TYPE;
	WOBSEXC	 VARCHAR(100);	
BEGIN
	
	CALL GETNEXTVALUE('E120EPE',1,'SELECT MAX(IDEEPE) FROM E120EPE',SEQUENCIAL);	
	
	SELECT PG_BACKEND_PID()	INTO WSERVID;
	BEGIN		
		SELECT		
			B.CODUSU
		  , A.APPUSR
		INTO		
		STRICT
			WCODUSU			
		  ,  WNOMUSU		  
		FROM
			R911SEC A
			INNER JOIN
				R999USU B
				ON
					A.APPUSR = B.NOMUSU
		WHERE
			A.NUMSEC = WSERVID;
		
		WOBSEXC := 'REGISTRO EXCLUÍDO PELO USUÁRIO: ' || WNOMUSU;	
	EXCEPTION			
	WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN
		WCODUSU := 0;
		WOBSEXC := 'REGISTRO EXCLUÍDO VIA WEBSERVICE OU VIA BANCO DE DADOS';
	END;	

	SELECT extract(minute from current_timestamp) + extract(hour from current_timestamp) * 60 INTO WHORA;

	INSERT INTO E120EPE (IDEEPE,CODEMP,CODFIL,NUMPED,CODREP,PEDPAL,INDEXP,HOREXC,DATEXC,USUEXC,OBSEXC)
	VALUES(SEQUENCIAL,OLD.CODEMP,OLD.CODFIL,OLD.NUMPED,OLD.CODREP,OLD.PEDPAL,0,WHORA,current_date,WCODUSU,WOBSEXC);
	
	RETURN OLD;
	
END
$function$
;

CREATE TRIGGER T120PEDD AFTER DELETE ON E120PED FOR EACH ROW 
