␀uÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ$¼␀␀™¨␀␀$¼␀␀<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ù␀³␀ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ?ý␀␀>ý␀␀>ý␀␀<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀ì␀xÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ1Ò␀␀ÌÑ␀␀ÏÑ␀␀V<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀é␀xÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ	Ò␀␀žÑ␀␀žÑ␀␀V<␀␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ï␀©ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿŒü␀␀Œü␀␀Œü␀␀J␀␀␀ÿÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀␀Ün␀␀Ýn␀␀Ûn␀␀␀	0;1;2;3;4´þ␀␀		SENIOR;0Q␀␀/* Triggers para alimentar dados para as tabelas de notificações do painel OEE
 * 
 * Após inserir: alimenta a tabela (E900EOO) de ligação entre tabela de movimentação de op/os e a tabela de 
 * notificações de operações do painel OEE. Essa trigger é definida apenas para oracle para obter o valor do 
 * ID único. No SqlServer o valor do identificador único é gerado através do campo do tipo Identity
 * 
 * Após atualizar: efetua a notificação direta para o painel OEE através de stored procedure
 * 
 * Após excluir: efetua a notificação direta para o painel OEE através de stored procedure e posteriormente 
 * exclui o registro na tabela E900EOO, pois não é feito mais nenhum tratamento com esta tabela.
 */ 
TRIGGER T900EOQAI AFTER INSERT ON E900EOQ FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	WIDEUNI INTEGER;
	EXISTE VARCHAR (01);
	CURSOR CUR_E900EOO IS
		   SELECT IDEUNI
		   FROM E900EOO
		   WHERE CODEMP = :NEW.CODEMP AND CODORI = :NEW.CODORI AND NUMORP = :NEW.NUMORP AND CODETG = :NEW.CODETG AND SEQEOQ = :NEW.SEQEOQ;
BEGIN
	INSERT INTO E900EOO (CODEMP, CODORI, NUMORP, CODETG, SEQEOQ) VALUES (:NEW.CODEMP, :NEW.CODORI, :NEW.NUMORP, :NEW.CODETG, :NEW.SEQEOQ);
	
	EXISTE := 'N';

	FOREACH CUR_E900EOO INTO WIDEUNI
	LOOP
		EXISTE := 'S';
	END LOOP;

	IF EXISTE = 'S' THEN  		    	
		SP_MGOE_NOTIF_CRE(:NEW.CODEMP, :NEW.CODCRE, NULL, NULL, WIDEUNI, 'I');  		
	END IF;	
END	ORACLE;0‡␀␀CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER T900EOQAI AFTER INSERT ON E900EOQ FOR EACH ROW 
DECLARE WIDEUNI INT;
BEGIN
	ATGETNEXTVALUE ('E900EOO_IDEUNI', 1, NULL, WIDEUNI);
	INSERT INTO E900EOO (IDEUNI, CODEMP, CODORI, NUMORP, CODETG, SEQEOQ) VALUES (WIDEUNI, :NEW.CODEMP, :NEW.CODORI, :NEW.NUMORP, :NEW.CODETG, :NEW.SEQEOQ);
	SP_MGOE_NOTIF_CRE(:NEW.CODEMP, :NEW.CODCRE, NULL, NULL, WIDEUNI, 'I');	
END;␀µþ␀␀		SENIOR;0õ␀␀


TRIGGER T900EOQAU AFTER UPDATE ON E900EOQ FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	WIDEUNI INTEGER;
	EXISTE VARCHAR (01);
	CURSOR CUR_E900EOO IS
		   SELECT IDEUNI
		   FROM E900EOO
		   WHERE CODEMP = :NEW.CODEMP AND CODORI = :NEW.CODORI AND NUMORP = :NEW.NUMORP AND CODETG = :NEW.CODETG AND SEQEOQ = :NEW.SEQEOQ;

BEGIN
	EXISTE := 'N';

	FOREACH CUR_E900EOO INTO WIDEUNI
	LOOP
		EXISTE := 'S';
	END LOOP;

	IF EXISTE = 'S' THEN
		SP_MGOE_NOTIF_CRE(:NEW.CODEMP, :NEW.CODCRE, NULL, NULL, WIDEUNI, 'A');
	END IF;  
END␀³þ␀␀		SENIOR;0-␀␀

TRIGGER T900EOQAD AFTER DELETE ON E900EOQ FOR EACH ROW
DECLARE
	WIDEUNI INTEGER;
	EXISTE VARCHAR (01);
	CURSOR CUR_E900EOO IS
		   SELECT IDEUNI
		   FROM E900EOO
		   WHERE CODEMP = :OLD.CODEMP AND CODORI = :OLD.CODORI AND NUMORP = :OLD.NUMORP AND CODETG = :OLD.CODETG AND SEQEOQ = :OLD.SEQEOQ;

BEGIN
	EXISTE := 'N';

	FOREACH CUR_E900EOO INTO WIDEUNI
	LOOP
		EXISTE := 'S';
	END LOOP;

	IF EXISTE = 'S' THEN  		    	
		SP_MGOE_NOTIF_CRE(:OLD.CODEMP, :OLD.CODCRE, NULL, NULL, WIDEUNI, 'E');  		
		DELETE E900EOO WHERE IDEUNI = WIDEUNI;   	 
	END IF;
