2ž<␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀ã␀␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀v²␀␀t²␀␀t²␀␀ä␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ùã␀␀/	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀±³␀␀²␀␀²␀␀ý␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Üã␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀(þ␀␀á␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Ûã␀␀/␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀%”q–qý␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Öã␀␀O␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀&¶y¸y␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀×ã␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀'ó§␀␀ô§␀␀ó␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀Úã␀␀O␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀$,!-!␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀Ò SELECT R999USU.CODUSU, R910USU.NOMCOM, R999USU.NOMUSU, 
       R999USU.TIPCOL, R999USU.NUMEMP, R999USU.CODFIL,
       R999USU.CODLOC, R999USU.NUMCAD 
FROM R999USU, R910USU
WHERE R999USU.CODUSU = R910USU.CODENT␀ÿØog␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿ5␀5␀F␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀g³␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Â5”qÂ5r<␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀gµ␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d6¶yd6y<␀␀ƒÿ␀␀V@␀g5	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀?“␀?W␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀g	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀”½␀␀Ï␀”½␀␀B␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀gÎ␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀IêCI‚@␀”ÿ␀␀ÿ␀	g‘␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ê/␀ˆ7␀ß/␀ <␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀gÈ␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<ýõ;]<␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀gN	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p9@␀n9\␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀gÎ␀	␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀µJÓ2␀é2␀‚@␀”ÿ␀␀ÿ␀␀€␀␀ SELECT 'A' E301TCR_VISAO, 
       E301TCR.CODEMP AS E301TCR_CODEMP, 
       E301TCR.CODFIL AS E301TCR_CODFIL,
       E301TCR.CODTPT AS E301TCR_CODTPT, 
       E301TCR.NUMTIT AS E301TCR_NUMTIT,
       E301TCR.DATENT AS E301TCR_DATENT, 
       E301TCR.VLRORI AS E301TCR_VLRORI,
       E301TCR.CODCLI AS E301TCR_CODCLI, 
       E301TCR.CODTNS AS E301TCR_CODTNS,
       E301TCR.VCTPRO AS E301TCR_VCTPRO
  FROM E301TCR
 WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT E301MCR.CODTPT, 
                          E301MCR.NUMTIT
                     FROM E001TNS, 
			  E070EMP, 
			  E301MCR 
                    WHERE E301MCR.CODEMP = E301TCR.CODEMP                    
                      AND E301MCR.CODFIL = E301TCR.CODFIL
                      AND E301MCR.CODTPT = E301TCR.CODTPT
                      AND E301MCR.NUMTIT = E301TCR.NUMTIT
                      AND E001TNS.CODEMP = E301MCR.CODEMP
                      AND E001TNS.CODTNS = E301MCR.CODTNS
                      AND E001TNS.LISMOD = 'CRB'
                      AND E070EMP.CODEMP = E301MCR.CODEMP
                      AND E301MCR.DATMOV <= E070EMP.DATPAL
                 GROUP BY E301MCR.CODTPT, 
                          E301MCR.NUMTIT
               HAVING SUM(E301MCR.VLRMOV) = E301TCR.VLRORI)
UNION
SELECT 'B' E301TCR_VISAO,  
       E301TCR.CODEMP AS E301TCR_CODEMP, 
       E301TCR.CODFIL AS E301TCR_CODFIL,
       E301TCR.CODTPT AS E301TCR_CODTPT, 
       E301TCR.NUMTIT AS E301TCR_NUMTIT,
       E301TCR.DATENT AS E301TCR_DATENT, 
       E301TCR.VLRORI AS E301TCR_VLRORI,
       E301TCR.CODCLI AS E301TCR_CODCLI, 
       E301TCR.CODTNS AS E301TCR_CODTNS,
       E301TCR.VCTPRO AS E301TCR_VCTPRO  
  FROM E301TCR␀␀ÿÒoŒ³␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Â5”q”qr<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀R@␀Ä±␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ ²␀␀²␀␀²␀␀Ý␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀¶µ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d6¶y¶yy<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀V@␀Ì±␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀€ä␀␀²␀␀²␀␀Ý␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀]yµ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀d6¶y¶yy<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀V@␀X±␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ä␀␀²␀␀²␀␀Ý␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀º 5␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀8Öý␀␀±ý␀␀W␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀e@␀X¶␀␀È␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¾º␀␀~·␀␀l¹␀␀]<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀òg␀2␀Û␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀V	␀Û␀ä␀K␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀ü÷␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀‡ù␀␀„ö␀␀Šø␀␀F␀␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀q÷␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ú␀␀Šø␀␀±ø␀␀&<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀®␀§␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿ&<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀ÿ␀»È␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀å<˜}Æ}]<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀b␀Í±␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀\³␀␀²␀␀²␀␀Ý␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀%P␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ÿÿÿÝ␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀·È␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀å<˜}Æ}]<␀␀␀ƒÿ␀␀b␀\±␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀_³␀␀œ±␀␀Õ³␀␀Ý␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀ÞU␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀tTxOUò␀␀␀ÿ␀␀ÿ␀§V␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
